    "id": 1,
    "content": "Which indicator is classified as a coincident indicator?\n哪个指标被归类为同步指标？",
    "options": [
      "ISM Manufacturing PMI\nISM制造业PMI",
      "Nonfarm Payrolls (NFP)\n非农就业 (NFP)",
      "Unemployment Rate\n失业率"
    ],
    "correctAnswerIndex": 1,
    "explanation": "Coincident indicators move in tandem with the economic cycle, directly reflecting current activity. NFP is the most impactful monthly coincident indicator—average monthly gains of 150k-200k signal stable employment, and it directly links to consumer spending (68-70% of GDP). ISM PMI is a leading indicator (>50 expansion, <50 contraction), while the Unemployment Rate is a lagging indicator that confirms cycle trends after they occur.\n同步指标与经济周期同步变动，直接反映当前经济活动。NFP是最具影响力的月度同步指标——月均增长15万-20万表明就业稳定，它直接关联消费支出（占GDP的68-70%）。ISM PMI是先行指标（>50为扩张，<50为收缩），而失业率是滞后指标，在周期转折发生后才确认趋势。",
    "category": "1. Macroeconomics / 宏观经济学"
  },
