    "id": 20,
    "content": "Which feature distinguishes ETFs from mutual funds?\n哪一特征将ETF与共同基金区分开来？",
    "options": [
      "Traded throughout the trading day\n在整个交易日内交易",
      "Invest in a diversified basket of assets\n投资于多元化资产篮子",
