      "One month after purchase\n购买后一个月"
    ],
    "correctAnswerIndex": 1,
    "explanation": "0DTE (Zero Days To Expiration) options expire at market close (4:00 PM ET) on the same trading day they are bought or sold, making them extremely short-term instruments. Introduced by CBOE in 2022 for SPX, 0DTE now accounts for 40-50% of S&P 500 options volume, with daily notional values exceeding $1 trillion. These options experience extreme theta decay—losing 50-80% of value in the final hours even without price movement. For example, an SPX 0DTE call bought at 10 AM for $5 might drop to $2 by 2 PM solely due to time decay. Traders use 0DTE for intraday directional bets on events like Fed announcements or earnings, but they're extremely risky—a wrong bet can lose 100% in hours.\n0DTE（零日到期）期权在买入或卖出的同一交易日收盘（美东时间下午4点）到期，使其成为极短期工具。由CBOE于2022年为SPX推出，0DTE现在占标普500期权交易量的40-50%，每日名义价值超过1万亿美元。这些期权经历极端theta衰减——即使没有价格变动，最后几小时也会损失50-80%的价值。例如，上午10点以5美元买入的SPX 0DTE看涨期权到下午2点可能仅因时间衰减跌至2美元。交易者使用0DTE对美联储公告或财报等事件进行日内方向性押注，但它们极具风险——押注错误可能在几小时内损失100%。",
    "category": "4. Options / 期权"
