    "correctAnswerIndex": 1,
    "explanation": "If a 0DTE call option finishes Out-of-The-Money (OTM) at the 4:00 PM ET market close—meaning the stock price is below the strike—it expires worthless and the buyer loses 100% of the premium paid. For example, buying a $450 SPY 0DTE call for $2 ($200 per contract) when SPY is at $448, hoping for a rally to $455, will result in total loss if SPY closes at $449.99 or below. There's no time for recovery—unlike weekly or monthly options, 0DTE gives you only hours to be right. This binary outcome makes 0DTE attractive to sellers (capturing rapid theta decay) but extremely risky for buyers. In volatile markets, 0DTE options can swing 200-500% intraday before expiring worthless, tempting retail traders but often resulting in 100% losses.\n如果0DTE看涨期权在美东时间下午4点收盘时为虚值（OTM）——意味着股价低于行权价——它过期作废，买方损失100%的已付权利金。例如，当SPY为448美元时以2美元（每份合约200美元）买入450美元SPY 0DTE看涨期权，希望涨至455美元，如果SPY收于449.99美元或以下将导致全部损失。没有时间恢复——与每周或每月期权不同，0DTE只给你几小时时间押对。这种二元结果使0DTE对卖方有吸引力（捕获快速theta衰减），但对买方极具风险。在波动市场中，0DTE期权可以在日内波动200-500%后到期作废，诱惑散户交易者但通常导致100%损失。",
    "category": "4. Options / 期权"
