  {
    "id": 44,
    "content": "How is NAV calculated for mutual funds?\n共同基金的NAV如何计算？",
    "options": [
      "Closing prices of holdings minus liabilities, divided by shares\n持仓收盘价减去负债，除以份额",
      "Based on market price only\n仅基于市场价格",
      "Fixed at $1 always\n始终固定在1美元"
    ],
    "correctAnswerIndex": 0,
    "explanation": "Net Asset Value (NAV) for mutual funds is calculated once daily at 4:00 PM ET market close using the formula: NAV = (Total Market Value of Holdings - Liabilities) / Outstanding Shares. For example, if a fund holds $100M in stocks, $5M in cash, owes $2M in fees, and has 10M shares outstanding, NAV = ($105M - $2M) / 10M = $10.30 per share. All trades placed during the day—whether at 9:30 AM or 3:59 PM—execute at the same 4 PM NAV (forward pricing). This differs from ETFs, which trade intraday at fluctuating market prices. Liabilities include management fees, operating expenses, and pending redemptions. NAV changes daily based on portfolio performance and dividend/capital gain distributions.\nNAV（资产净值）对于共同基金在美东时间下午4点市场收盘时每日计算一次，使用公式：NAV =（持仓总市值-负债）/流通份额。例如，如果一个基金持有1亿美元股票、500万美元现金、欠200万美元费用，且有1000万份额流通，NAV =（1.05亿美元-200万美元）/1000万 = 每份额10.30美元。当天下单的所有交易——无论是上午9:30还是下午3:59——都以相同的下午4点NAV执行（前瞻定价）。这与ETF不同，ETF以波动的市场价格日内交易。负债包括管理费、运营费用和待处理赎回。NAV基于投资组合表现和股息/资本收益分配每日变化。",
    "category": "5. Funds / 基金"
  },
