    "id": 46,
    "content": "Who are private markets like PE suitable for?\n私募股权等私募市场适合谁？",
    "options": [
      "Accredited investors with high net worth\n高净值的合格投资者",
      "Beginners with low minimums\n低门槛的初学者",
