    "id": 70,
    "content": "How to find analyst ratings in MooMoo?\n如何在MooMoo中找到分析师评级？",
    "options": [
      "Select company > Analyst Ratings > Target Price/Rating Details\n选择公司 > 分析师评级 > 目标价/评级明细",
